      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_010_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "4178CA401BDFC2D1",
      "text": "真是的！不是这句吧！\\n你应该说“今天星苦了～”才对吧？[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
